HINT.fill_3d = "Click a pattern on the garment: a box with its Fill (0 to 100); the cloth swells as you drag the slider while simulating (Space). The same value as the Property Editor's Simulation ▸ Fill.";
/* ---- Quick Pinching and Pin (Lasso) ---- */
